---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Quality Policy"
  description="Eurocert quality policy - impartial, competent and consistent inspection and certification services in line with ISO/IEC 17020, 17021 and 17065 standards."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/quality-policy/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367713/eurocert/q1.png.png" alt="Quality Policy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_25%]"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/70 to-[#030a16]/40"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Our Standards</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Quality <span class="text-eurogold-400">Policy</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-4"><span class="text-white/70">Quality Policy</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Independence &amp; Integrity</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Third-Party <span class="text-euro-600">Excellence</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT â€“ European Inspection and Certification Company S.A. acts as a third-party inspection, auditing, certification and verification body and thus its operation depends upon the independence and integrity as well as on the impartiality and competence of its management and personnel.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT also declares that it understands the importance of impartiality in the audits and verifications it undertakes and commits to assure through documented procedures the conflict of interest and objectiveness of all involved in them.</p><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 border border-euro-100"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-medal text-white text-lg"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Total Quality Commitment</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We are all, at EUROCERT, committed to the total quality of the services provided.</p></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="relative w-full max-w-[280px] aspect-square rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-xl bg-white flex items-center justify-center p-8"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png" alt="EUROCERT Logo" class="w-full h-auto object-contain"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Accreditation Standards</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Internationally <span class="text-eurogold-400">Recognised</span></h2></div><p class="text-white/60 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Our target is that all inspections, certifications and verifications we undertake are accredited in compliance to the standards: <span class="text-white/90 font-medium">ISO/IEC 17020, ISO/IEC 17021, ISO/IEC 17024, ISO/IEC 17029, ISO/IEC 17043, ISO/IEC 17065</span> and <span class="text-white/90 font-medium">EC Regulation 1221/2009 (EMAS)</span>.</p><p class="text-white/60 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT also owns and maintains accreditation from the British Accreditation Body, <span class="text-eurogold-400 font-medium">UKAS</span>, in compliance to ISO/IEC 17065 and accreditation by the American Accreditation Body, <span class="text-eurogold-400 font-medium">SAAS</span>, in compliance to ISO/IEC 17021 and Procedure SAAS P200.</p><p class="text-white/60 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We also aim to provide inspection services in compliance to <span class="text-white/90 font-medium">MLC, 2006</span> under approval by Government Flag Administrations as well as the organisation of examinations for certification of technical professions.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17020</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Inspection</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17021</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Management Systems</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17024</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Personnel Certification</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17029</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Verification</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17043</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Proficiency Testing</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 text-center"><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 tracking-wider mb-1">ISO/IEC 17065</p><p class="text-white/40 text-[11px]">Product Certification</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Leadership</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Management <span class="text-euro-600">Commitment</span></h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-tools text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Resources &amp; Support</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The company management is committed to provide always all the required means in order for all personnel to comprehend and apply the Quality Policy.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Legal Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The management of the company is committed to the observance of the legislation, including the one that concerns the employees and health and safety.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-book text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Quality System</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">All who undertake works for EUROCERT shall implement the Quality System as it is exactly written in the Quality Manual and its related Quality Procedures and Regulations.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-user-tie text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Executive Responsibility</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">EUROCERT&#x27;s Top Management appoints the Managing Director to be the responsible executive for the body&#x27;s operation and the Quality Assurance Director to be the Management Representative for the control and implementation of EUROCERT&#x27;s Quality System, Accreditations and Approvals.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Code of Conduct</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Employee Obligations</h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-ban text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Avoid Conflicts</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Employees should avoid actions or relationships that may cause potential conflicts or create the impression of conflicts with EUROCERT&#x27;s activity or interests.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-gift text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">No Gifts or Benefits</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every employee should be cautious about gifts or other benefits to those who wish to cooperate with EUROCERT and not accept any object or benefit, of any value.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-laptop text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Protect Resources</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Employees do not violate EUROCERT&#x27;s material resources, intellectual property, time or facilities for personal gain.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Respect Professional Boundaries</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every employee shall respect and not consider any opportunity or acquaintance made on behalf of EUROCERT, as part of their cooperation and in the capacity conferred on him/her.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-user-shield text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Independence in Service</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Those providing services on behalf of EUROCERT must be independent and avoid conflicts of interest that may create an incentive to report anything other than the actual and accurate facts gathered during the service offering.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 border border-euro-100"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-white text-lg"></i></div><div class="space-y-3"><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Regulatory Compliance Statement</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT states that it is committed to execute its duties and responsibilities that flow from the compliance to the requirements of the accreditation standards, the accreditation bodies&#x27; and competent authorities&#x27; operation regulations and of the national and regulatory legislation that concerns the notified bodies.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf text-eurogold-400 text-2xl"></i></div><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-3">Download Full <span class="text-eurogold-400">Quality Policy</span></h2><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">Access the complete EUROCERT Quality Policy document in PDF format for your records.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center"><a href="/quality.pdf" download="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20"><i class="fas fa-download text-[10px]"></i>Download PDF</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/20 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:border-eurogold-400/50 hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-all" href="/contact/">Contact Us <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
